  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Moldova&apos;s participation in Erasmus+ programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support will take the form of an increase of the number of ICM available for the Higher Education Institutions of the Republic of Moldova participating in Key Action 1 of the Erasmus+ programme, promoting the international exchange of students and staff between institutions in Erasmus+ Programme and Partner Countries.</narrative>
  </description>
